++{"seq": 59, "ts": 1792081639.603, "role": "tool", "content": "{\"ok\": true, \"exit_code\": 0, \"result\": \"{\\\"cmd\\\": \\\"grep -o 'MEPAN demonstrates a role.\\\\\\\\{0,1500\\\\\\\\}' flat.txt | head -c 1700; echo; echo ===; grep -o 'We strongly recommend that ES/GS.\\\\\\\\{0,1200\\\\\\\\}' flat.txt | head -c 1400\\\", \\\"exit_code\\\": 0, \\\"stdout\\\": \\\"MEPAN demonstrates a role for mitochondrial fatty acid synthesis \\\\\\\\r       in iron-sulfur cluster and supercomplex formation.\\\\\\\\r PG  - e2506761122\\\\\\\\r LID - 10.1073/pnas.2506761122 [doi]\\\\\\\\r LID - e2506761122\\\\\\\\r AB  - MEPAN (Mitochondrial Enoyl CoA Reductase Protein-Associated Neurodegeneration) is \\\\\\\\r       an early-onset movement disorder characterized by ataxia, dysarthria, and optic \\\\\\\\r       atrophy. Here, we report the creation of a mouse model of MEPAN with \\\\\\\\r       patient-similar compound heterozygous mutations in the Mecr gene. The MEPAN mouse \\\\\\\\r       recapitulates the major hallmarks of MEPAN, including a movement disorder, optic \\\\\\\\r       neuropathy, defects in protein lipoylation, and reduced mitochondrial oxidative \\\\\\\\r       phosphorylation in the brain. MECR catalyzes the last step in mitochondrial fatty \\\\\\\\r       acid synthesis (mtFASII), and the mechanism by which loss of mtFASII leads to \\\\\\\\r       neurological disease is unknown. LC-MS/MS-based proteomic analysis of Mecr mutant \\\\\\\\r       cerebella identified loss of subunits of complex I of oxidative phosphorylation \\\\\\\\r       (OXPHOS) and subunits of the iron-sulfur cluster assembly (ISC) complex. Native \\\\\\\\r       gels revealed altered OXPHOS complex and supercomplex formation and changes in \\\\\\\\r       binding of the acyl carrier protein (ACP) to mitochondrial complexes. These \\\\\\\\r       results demonstrate that MECR plays a key role in the acylation of ACP which is \\\\\\\\r       necessary for ACP-LYRM-mediated supercomplex modulation and ISC biogenesis an\\\\n\\\\n===\\\\nWe strongly recommend that ES/GS be considered as a \\\\\\\\r       first- or second-tier test for patients with CA/DD/ID.\\\\\\\\r CI  - © 2021. The Author(s), under exclusive licence to the American College of Medical \\\\\\\\r       Genetics and Genomics.\\\\\\\\r FAU - Manickam, Kandamurugu\\\\\\\\r AU  - Manickam K\\\\\\\\r AD  - Division of Genetic and Genomic Medicine, Department of Pediatrics, Nationwide \\\\\\\\r       Children&#x27;s Hospital, Columbus, OH, USA.\\\\\\\\r AD  - The Ohio State University College of Medicine, Columbus, OH, USA.\\\\\\\\r FAU - McClain, Monica R\\\\\\\\r AU  - McClain MR\\\\\\\\r AD  - Scientific and Strategic Affairs, Evidera | PPD, Waltham, MA, USA.\\\\\\\\r FAU - Demmer, Laurie A\\\\\\\\r AU  - Demmer LA\\\\\\\\r AD  - Division of Medical Genetics, Department of Pediatrics, Atrium Health&#x27;s Levine \\\\\\\\r       Children&#x27;s Hospital, Charlotte, NC, USA.\\\\\\\\r FAU - Biswas, Sawona\\\\\\\\r AU  - Biswas S\\\\\\\\r AD  - Division of Adult Genetics, Department of Pathology, University of California San \\\\\\\\r       Francisco, San Francisco, CA, USA.\\\\\\\\r FAU - Kearney, Hutton M\\\\\\\\r AU  - Kearney HM\\\\\\\\r AD  - Division of Laboratory Genetics and Genomics, Department of Laboratory Medicine \\\\\\\\r       and Pathology, Mayo Clinic, Rochester, MN, USA.\\\\\\\\r FAU - Malinowski, Jennifer\\\\\\\\r AU  - Malinowski J\\\\\\\\r AD \\\\n\\\", \\\"stderr\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"sandbox\\\": \\\"sandbox: docker[busybox] (fs=C:/Users/agent/work/project/test-runs/test7-doctor/t7-20261015-215453-0b70, network=off)\\\"}\", \"truncated\": false, \"total_bytes\": 3171, \"artifact_ref\": null, \"duration_ms\": 0}", "tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b994c70c1703d8fc", "name": "run_command", "step": 23}
