ams, modulation of \r       which differentially affects T cell fate and function. Lipid metabolism is \r       fundamental yet remains poorly understood across CD4+ T cell subsets. Therefore, \r       we performed targeted in vivo CRISPR/Cas9 screens to identify lipid metabolism \r       genes and pathways essential for T cell functions. Thes"
